---
/**
 * -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
 * SEEING.MD HOME PAGE
 * Route: /
 * Type: Page
 * Page version: 0.9.6 (subtract pass; SEEING.md 0.9.6)
 * -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
 *
 * PURPOSE
 * Introduces SEEING.md as a portable perception specification for people and
 * AI. One question carries the page: what have we already defined?
 *
 * AUDIENCE AND PRIMARY ACTION
 * - Audience: Leaders, teams, AI practitioners, designers, developers,
 *   consultants, coaches, and individual practitioners
 * - Primary action: Download SEEING.md
 * - Leader action: Seeing First, linked to its section on seedifferent.xyz
 *
 * EXPERIENCE / STRUCTURE
 * Black opens and closes the page (the definition → the file); white holds the
 * practice between.
 * Hero → Practice (What is this? What is it for?) → What AI amplifies (with the
 * movement and "What were we all assuming?") → Limits → Use (dark) → Footer.
 * Three spoken questions, one method, one action.
 *
 * SUBTRACT PASS (13 October 2026)
 * Removed the nav links, Start Here dialog, the Separate / Surface / Ask list
 * (it competed with the movement), the "underperformer" example (named in the
 * hero), the duplicate Begin headline, and the second black band. Merged Lens
 * and Scope into one quiet pair; folded Origin into the footer.
 *
 * DEPENDENCIES
 * - Layout: Standalone Astro page; no shared layout dependency
 * - Assets: Embedded open-frame SVG logo/favicon and public /SEEING.md
 * - Services: Google Fonts, Fathom, Cabin, and SEE DIFFERENT
 * - Hosting: Cloudflare Workers with Static Assets
 *
 * EDITING GUARDRAILS
 * - Suede: Google Sans Flex; type scale 12, 14, 16, 18, 20, 24, 30, 36, 48,
 *   60px (hero display may exceed 60px); body 18px / 1.75; headings 500.
 * - Spacing scale: 20, 30, 40, 60, 80, 100px. Reading measure 640px;
 *   composition width 1280px.
 * - Color: black, white, and #aa6600 only, through the opacity ladder
 *   (80 / 60 / 50 / 15). Primary buttons are accent-filled.
 * - Width axis: "wdth" 110 for the hero and the Use headline only.
 * - Motion: 250ms interface transitions, ease-out.
 * - Before adding a section, ask what it repeats. Keep one method on the page.
 * - Keep the downloadable specification synchronized with the canonical
 *   SEEING.md file at the repository root.
 * - Do not imply that SEEING.md resolves every category of AI safety risk.
 * - Keep external links secure with rel="noopener".
 * -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
 */

const title = 'SEEING.md — The Perception Behind Intent';
const description =
  'A practice of noticing what we have already decided we are seeing. Begins before AI, with a portable file for examining what our instructions may amplify.';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="description" content={description} />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#000000" />
    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
    <meta property="og:title" content={title} />
    <meta property="og:description" content={description} />
    <meta property="og:url" content="https://seeing.md/" />
    <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary" />
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://seeing.md/" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%2032%2032%22%3E%3Cstyle%3Epath%7Bstroke%3A%2311110f%7D%40media%28prefers-color-scheme%3Adark%29%7Bpath%7Bstroke%3A%23fff%7D%7D%3C%2Fstyle%3E%3Cpath%20d%3D%22M20%204H4V28H28V10%22%20fill%3D%22none%22%20stroke-width%3D%223.2%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Google+Sans+Flex:opsz,wdth,wght@6..144,75..125,100..1000&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
    <title>{title}</title>
    <script src="https://scripts.withcabin.com/hello.js" async defer></script>
    <!-- Fathom - beautiful, simple website analytics -->
    <script src="https://cdn.usefathom.com/script.js" data-site="MWASYWBA" defer></script>
    <!-- / Fathom -->
  </head>

  <body>
    <header class="site-header">
      <a class="wordmark" href="/" aria-label="SEEING.md home">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" width="24" height="24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
          <path d="M20 4H4V28H28V10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3.2" />
        </svg>
        <span>SEEING.md</span>
      </a>
      <a class="link" href="#use">Get the file</a>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="hero dark" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
        <h1 id="hero-title">We don’t question what we’ve already defined.</h1>
        <p class="names">The problem. The customer. The underperformer. The strategy.</p>
        <p class="premise">What if the smallest change with the greatest consequence isn’t a change in what we do, but a change in how we see?</p>
        <a class="button" href="#use">Get SEEING.md <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </section>

      <section class="practice" id="pause" aria-labelledby="practice-title">
        <p class="label">Begin without AI</p>
        <h2 id="practice-title">What is this?<br />What is it for?</h2>
        <p>Bring to mind the thing you feel surest of. The first answer may be the old definition repeating itself. Leave the question open a little longer.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="ai" id="why" aria-labelledby="ai-title">
        <p class="label">What AI amplifies</p>
        <h2 id="ai-title">AI scales what we see.<br />And what we don’t.</h2>
        <p class="body">Before we hand a task to AI, we have already given it a way of seeing the situation. SEEING.md is a portable file that helps both of you examine that seeing before it becomes action.</p>
        <p class="movement" aria-label="The movement: Notice, Question, See again, Act"><b>Notice <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></b> <b>Question <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></b> <b>See again <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></b> <b>Act</b></p>

        <div class="after">
          <p class="whisper">Who got this wrong?</p>
          <h3>What were we all <em>assuming?</em></h3>
          <p>A picture everyone accepted has no single author. When AI acts on it, the same assumption can show up in many places at once, and looking for fault ends the looking.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="limits" aria-label="Limits">
        <div>
          <h2>A lens. Not the lens.</h2>
          <p>Any insight about perception that cannot question itself becomes another lens. Question this file too.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2>Upstream, not all-encompassing.</h2>
          <p>It addresses the human assumptions in purpose, data, measures, prompts, and use. It does not prevent malicious use, deception, or loss of control.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="use dark" id="use" aria-labelledby="use-title">
        <h2 id="use-title">Get SEEING.md</h2>
        <p class="intro">Attach it to an AI conversation, a brief, or a project. Then ask the AI to read it first.</p>
        <a class="button" href="/SEEING.md" download onclick="window.fathom?.trackEvent('SEEING.md download');">Download SEEING.md <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
        <p class="note">Version 0.9.6 · 13 October 2026 · Free under CC BY 4.0</p>
        <blockquote>Read SEEING.md before responding. Apply it when the work involves people, judgment, strategy, interpretation, or a consequential decision. Question what may be shaping the request, including the assumptions this file brings to the inquiry.</blockquote>
        <div class="more" id="seeing-first">
          <p>For leaders and teams: a private 30 minutes on what happens when decisions scale.</p>
          <a class="link" href="https://seedifferent.xyz/#seeing-first" rel="noopener">Seeing First <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
      <p class="close">Seeing is the first decision.</p>
      <a href="mailto:hello@seeing.md">hello@seeing.md</a>
      <p class="origin">SEEING.md grew from <a href="https://seedifferent.xyz/perception-miracle/" rel="noopener"><em>The Perception Miracle</em></a> and more than 500 explorations. Its form was influenced by Brian Gardner’s DESIGN.md.</p>
      <p class="meta">
        <span>© 2026 <a href="https://billfox.co/" rel="author">Bill Fox</a>. Licensed under <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/" rel="license noopener">CC BY 4.0</a>.</span>
        <a href="https://seedifferent.xyz" rel="noopener">SEE DIFFERENT</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/billfoxco/seeing-md" rel="noopener">Source and changelog</a>
      </p>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>

<style is:global>
  :root {
    --ink: #000; --paper: #fff; --amber: #aa6600;
    --w80: rgba(255,255,255,.8); --w60: rgba(255,255,255,.6); --w15: rgba(255,255,255,.15);
    --b60: rgba(0,0,0,.6); --b50: rgba(0,0,0,.5); --b15: rgba(0,0,0,.15);
    --expanded: "wdth" 110;
    --content: 1280px; --measure: 640px;
    --gutter: max(20px, calc((100% - var(--content)) / 2));
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
  body {
    margin: 0; background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink);
    font-family: "Google Sans Flex", ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.75;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;
  }
  h1, h2, h3, p { margin: 0; text-wrap: pretty; }
  h1, h2, h3 { font-weight: 500; }
  a { color: inherit; }
  .site-header, main > section, footer { padding-inline: var(--gutter); }

  .label { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: .05em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--b60); }

  .button {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 20px; padding: 20px 30px;
    background: var(--amber); color: var(--paper); border: 1px solid var(--amber);
    font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: .05em; text-transform: uppercase; text-decoration: none;
    transition: background 250ms ease-out, color 250ms ease-out, border-color 250ms ease-out;
  }
  .button:hover { background: transparent; color: var(--paper); border-color: var(--paper); }
  .link { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; text-underline-offset: 5px; text-decoration-color: var(--b50); transition: color 250ms ease-out; }
  .link:hover { color: var(--amber); }
  .dark .link, .site-header .link { text-decoration-color: var(--w60); }
  :focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--amber); outline-offset: 4px; }

  .site-header { position: absolute; inset: 0 0 auto; z-index: 1; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding-block: 30px; color: var(--paper); }
  .wordmark { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; font-size: 20px; letter-spacing: -.02em; text-decoration: none; }
  .wordmark svg { display: block; }
  .site-header .link { font-size: 14px; color: var(--w80); }

  .dark { background: var(--ink); color: var(--paper); }
  .hero { min-height: 100svh; display: grid; align-content: center; padding-block: 140px 100px; }
  .hero h1 { max-width: 1000px; font-size: clamp(36px, 6vw, 72px); font-variation-settings: var(--expanded); line-height: 1.05; }
  .hero .names { margin-top: 40px; font-size: 20px; color: var(--w60); }
  .hero .premise { max-width: var(--measure); margin-top: 20px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--w80); }
  .hero .button { margin-top: 60px; justify-self: start; }

  .practice { padding-block: 100px; }
  .practice h2 { margin-top: 30px; font-size: clamp(36px, 5vw, 60px); line-height: 1.1; }
  .practice p:last-child { max-width: var(--measure); margin-top: 40px; color: var(--b60); }

  .ai { padding-block: 100px; border-top: 1px solid var(--b15); }
  .ai h2 { margin-top: 30px; font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 48px); line-height: 1.1; }
  .ai .body { max-width: var(--measure); margin-top: 40px; color: var(--b60); }
  .movement { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px 20px; margin-top: 60px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: .05em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .movement b { font-weight: inherit; white-space: nowrap; }
  .movement span { margin-left: 20px; color: var(--b50); }
  .after { margin-top: 100px; }
  .after .whisper { font-size: 24px; color: var(--b50); }
  .after h3 { margin-top: 20px; font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 48px); line-height: 1.1; }
  .after h3 em { font-style: normal; color: var(--amber); }
  .after p:last-child { max-width: var(--measure); margin-top: 30px; color: var(--b60); }

  .limits { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 80px; padding-block: 60px 100px; }
  .limits h2 { font-size: 20px; }
  .limits p { max-width: 520px; margin-top: 20px; font-size: 16px; color: var(--b60); }

  .use { padding-block: 100px; }
  .use h2 { font-size: clamp(36px, 5vw, 60px); font-variation-settings: var(--expanded); line-height: 1.05; }
  .use .intro { max-width: var(--measure); margin-top: 30px; color: var(--w80); }
  .use .button { margin-top: 40px; }
  .use .note { margin-top: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--w60); }
  .use blockquote { max-width: var(--measure); margin: 60px 0 0; padding-left: 20px; border-left: 1px solid var(--amber); font-size: 16px; color: var(--w80); }
  .use .more { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; gap: 20px 40px; margin-top: 60px; padding-top: 30px; border-top: 1px solid var(--w15); }
  .use .more p { font-size: 16px; color: var(--w60); }

  footer { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; gap: 30px 60px; padding-block: 60px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--b60); }
  footer .close { font-size: 20px; color: var(--ink); }
  footer .origin { max-width: var(--measure); grid-column: 1; }
  footer .meta { grid-column: 1 / -1; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px 30px; padding-top: 30px; border-top: 1px solid var(--b15); }
  footer a { text-underline-offset: 3px; }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    body { font-size: 16px; }
    .hero { min-height: auto; padding-block: 120px 80px; }
    .hero .names, .hero .premise { font-size: 18px; }
    .hero .button { margin-top: 40px; }
    .practice, .ai, .use { padding-block: 60px; }
    .after { margin-top: 60px; }
    .after .whisper { font-size: 20px; }
    .limits { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 40px; padding-block: 40px 60px; }
    footer { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    html { scroll-behavior: auto; }
    * { transition-duration: .01ms !important; }
  }
</style>
